{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266W7hvr3fX31795681824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朝鮮領袖金正恩視察核設施，要求全面部署戰術核武、擴大產能。</p><p></p><p>朝中社報道，金正恩周三實地考察核武研發及核材料生產設施，強調在朝鮮半島分裂的狀態下，有必要針對韓國研發戰術核武。核武部門應專注於在多個領域部署戰術核武，並表示朝鮮正有系統地擴大核原料產能。重申朝鮮擁核地位絕對不可侵犯，不會接受無核化。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM-0930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026klWmoyOcK41795658854.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中俄美元首上周深圳會談後發聲明，三國將就減少核風險、防止核擴散進行對話。韓國韓聯社報道在這背景下，金正恩視察核設施備受關注。路透社引述專家分析，朝鮮是想以擁核國身份，參與未來的對話。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:14:59.446756+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.436436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:19.317580+00:00","content_hash":"925d3511b44c619cfab0a9b37963be602bc782c22e174926e9621a9279196e46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:14:59.446756+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}